OL,3,GNEWSAHusband who drugged and raped wife
OL,4,Awas 'monster', jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA man who drugged and raped his wife
OL,10,Ffor more than 20 years could turn in a
OL,11,Fminute from an apparently loving
OL,12,Fhusband into a "monster", a court has
OL,13,Fheard.
OL,15,FThe man, in his 60s, from Stockport,
OL,16,Fhas admitted committing the offences
OL,17,Fagainst his wife without her knowledge
OL,18,Fand allowing other men to engage in
OL,19,Fsexual activity with her at their
OL,20,Fmarital home.
